%N A398193 Triangle read by rows: T(n, k) = n! * [x^n] (T(x) / (1 - T(x)))^(n - k + 1) if k > 0 and delta_{n, 0} if k = 0, where T(x) = -W(-x) is Euler's tree function, and W Lambert's function.
